DESCRIPTION:The Lenches Pre-School Christmas Fayre is on Friday 11 December
 \, 3.30pm to 5.30pm\, and all are welcome. There will be a lucky dip\, tom
 bola\, local traders\, cakes and tea. Tombola donations and bric-a-brac ca
 n be dropped off at the pre-school between 8.30am and 3.30pm\, or contact 
 Daisy on 07817739562. To book a stall (£10 a table)\, email the secretary
 \, Sinead.\n\nBook a stall: email Sinead: mailto:secretary@thelenchespresc
 hool.org.uk\n\nThe Harvington Website: https://harvingtonvillage.org.uk/ev
 ents/2026-12-11-christmas-fayre-the-lenches-pre-school/
